I suppose you mean Gauntlets of Power, which will set your STR to 25?

According to the table in the weapons spoiler, that would provide an
additional +1 hit rating and +3 damage over a STR of 18/59, whereas you
would lose a lot of +hit from not wearing the DEX gauntlets.

You can look up the table yourself at
http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/341/weap-341.html - it's right above
the "Calculating damage" chapter.

Wearing them will also slightly increase your carrying capacity, just
put 'em on and see for yourself if the difference is big enough to be
noticeable (probably not).

Oh, and they will defininetly interfere with spellcasting, since GoP
are always considered metal armor, no matter how they "look" in your
particular game (riding gloves, fencing gloves or whatever)... though I
don't know how much the penalty for wearing one piece of metal armor
will affect your spellcasting abilites in practice. You may be able to
just ignore it or compensate it by wearing a robe.



